<!--
  Nothing is set here, on purpose. This file is a fence, as Directory.Build.props
  beside it is.

  The new Windows app keeps the versions of the packages it uses in one file in the
  folder above (../Directory.Packages.props). A project that finds that file may not
  give a version of its own, and the first editor's project does. With this file it
  finds this one first, and keeps its versions where they always were.
-->
<Project>
</Project>
